WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.102
This is Homework.

00:00:01.102 --> 00:00:05.058
What school sets appears here, with a colour coded countdown.

00:00:05.058 --> 00:00:07.847
Stuck on something? Press the Stuck button.

00:00:07.847 --> 00:00:10.506
It gives you hints in order, one to four.

00:00:10.506 --> 00:00:15.370
Each one lights the way a bit more, but it never writes the answer for you.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:18.029
When you finish, tick it off and earn XP.

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:21.985
If you only did part, say so, and the app will plan the rest.

00:00:21.985 --> 00:00:25.033
Less staring at the page, more getting it done.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:27.951
Try it now: open your next piece of homework.

